1013		Define 
1014		\[
1015			\hat{Q}^{x,z,\alpha,\beta}_{c} = \sum_{\substack{a,b:\\ \alpha a + \beta b = c}} \hat{Q}^{x,z}_{a,b}.
1016		\]
1017		The self-consistency and consistency properties of $\{ \hat{Q}^{x,z,\alpha,\beta}_{c} \}$ follow from the consistency properties of $\{ \hat{Q}^{x,z}_{a,b} \}$ established by Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-10}, and Fact~\ref{fact:data-processing}. 
