1099	      \item Suppose $\ell$ is a random diagonal line $(v, s, w)$,
1100	        where $v = (v_\xpt, v_\zpt, \alpha, \beta)$, and
1101	        where $w = (w_\xpt, w_\zpt, \gamma, \delta) $ is a direction vector whose first nonzero coordinate is
